OL,3,ANepal rescuers blast hillside in search
OL,4,Aof hydropower workers as families wait
OL,5,Aanxiously
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe families of more than 600 workers
OL,8,Fbelieved to be trapped in a vast
OL,9,Fnetwork of mud-filled tunnels along
OL,10,FNepal's Trishuli River are clinging to
OL,11,Fhope their loved ones can be found
OL,12,Falive.
OL,14,FRescuers continued battling to reach
OL,15,Fthem on Monday, using explosives to
OL,16,Fblast into the hillside before pumping
OL,17,Fair into the Trishuli-3A site ` fearing
OL,18,Fa critical window to reach survivors is
OL,19,Fclosing.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
